{"suttaId":"tha-ap449","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[950,973],"vripara":"42"},"segments":{"tha-ap449:0.3":"Sīhāsanikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap449:1.1":"“Padumuttarassa bhagavato, sabbabhūtahitesino;","tha-ap449:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, sīhāsanamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap449:2.1":"“Devaloke manusse vā, yattha yattha vasāmahaṃ;","tha-ap449:2.3":"Labhāmi vipulaṃ byamhaṃ, sīhāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap449:3.1":"“Soṇṇamayā rūpimayā, lohitaṅgamayā [lohitaṅkamayā (sī. syā. pī.)] bahū;","tha-ap449:3.3":"Maṇimayā ca pallaṅkā, nibbattanti mamaṃ sadā.","tha-ap449:4.1":"“Bodhiyā āsanaṃ katvā, jalajuttamanāmino;","tha-ap449:4.3":"Ucce kule pajāyāmi, aho dhammasudhammatā.","tha-ap449:5.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, sīhāsanamakāsahaṃ;","tha-ap449:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, sīhāsanassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap449:6.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap449:7.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap449:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap449:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sīhāsaniko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap449:10.1":"Sīhāsanikattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
